### Data Controls API - try every endpoint (VS Code "REST Client" / Visual Studio / Rider).
### Start the API first:  dotnet run --project backend/src/DataControls.Api   (or .\run-all.ps1)
@api = http://localhost:5080/api

### ---------- catalog (business terms only) ----------

### Entities with their fields and relations
GET {{api}}/catalog/entities

### Operators with Hebrew labels and the data types they apply to
GET {{api}}/catalog/operators

### ---------- check a definition before saving ----------

### Valid → the Hebrew sentence it means
POST {{api}}/controls/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schemaVersion": 1, "rootEntity": "employee",
  "filter": { "type": "group", "logic": "and", "children": [
    { "type": "condition", "field": "age", "operator": "lt", "operand": { "kind": "literal", "value": 18 } },
    { "type": "condition", "field": "salary", "operator": "gt", "operand": { "kind": "literal", "value": 15000 } } ] }
}

### Invalid → errors pointing at the offending node
POST {{api}}/controls/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schemaVersion": 1, "rootEntity": "employee",
  "filter": { "type": "group", "logic": "and", "children": [
    { "type": "condition", "field": "age", "operator": "contains", "operand": { "kind": "literal", "value": "x" } } ] }
}

### ---------- manage controls ----------

### List (optional search in name / description)
GET {{api}}/controls?search=

### Create
# @name created
POST {{api}}/controls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "עובדים פעילים במחלקה לא פעילה (דוגמה)",
  "description": "נוצרה מקובץ requests.http",
  "definition": {
    "schemaVersion": 1, "rootEntity": "employee",
    "filter": { "type": "group", "logic": "and", "children": [
      { "type": "condition", "field": "isActive", "operator": "eq", "operand": { "kind": "literal", "value": true } },
      { "type": "condition", "field": "department.isActive", "operator": "eq", "operand": { "kind": "literal", "value": false } } ] }
  }
}

### Read it back
GET {{api}}/controls/{{created.response.body.id}}

### Run it (records the outcome) → violations with a reason per record
POST {{api}}/controls/{{created.response.body.id}}/run

### Browse the results: search, column filter, sort, paging (no new run recorded)
POST {{api}}/controls/{{created.response.body.id}}/results
Content-Type: application/json

{ "page": 1, "pageSize": 10, "search": "", "sortKey": "fullName", "sortDescending": false, "filters": [] }

### Update (clears the last-run result)
PUT {{api}}/controls/{{created.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "עובדים פעילים במחלקה לא פעילה (דוגמה, עודכן)",
  "definition": {
    "schemaVersion": 1, "rootEntity": "employee",
    "filter": { "type": "group", "logic": "and", "children": [
      { "type": "condition", "field": "department.isActive", "operator": "eq", "operand": { "kind": "literal", "value": false } } ] }
  }
}

### Delete
DELETE {{api}}/controls/{{created.response.body.id}}

### ---------- errors (Hebrew ProblemDetails) ----------

### 404 - unknown control
GET {{api}}/controls/999999

### 400 - missing name and definition
POST {{api}}/controls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "" }

### 400 - unknown property is rejected (strict contract)
POST {{api}}/controls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "x", "sql": "DROP TABLE biz.Employees" }

### Stage B - a control from free text (AI service mock on :8001); nothing is saved or run
POST {{api}}/ai/suggest-control
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "מצא עובדים פעילים שגילם נמוך מ־18 ומשכורתם גבוהה מ־15,000 ש\"ח." }

### Stage B - the AI invents a field: shown with the validation error, never run
POST {{api}}/ai/suggest-control
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "דמה שגיאה" }
